it's kind in the whole city.  This also appears to be one of the few areas

with a completely unobstructed view of the heavens.  All about the perimeter

of this platform sticks are mounted, pointing to locations where various

constellations are spotted at certain times of the year.  In the center of the

platform a large hollow log is mounted, on some kind of stand.

