must protect it from the stray spark.  The floor is a huge flat slab of stone,

and standing in the middle is a great open hearth.  It is quite hot in here,

and lit by the hearth in shifting yellows and reds.  The trunk of the tree

composes the north east wall, and hanging from it and from many branches that

crisscross the room, are items of war.

