"A Place of Repose"
"You are inside the hollow of a massive tree.  The tree itself must be massive

for the space within is easily a score of feet across in any direction.  An

enchantment lights the room with a warm, golden glow providing ample light in

day or night.  The floor of the chamber is buffed to a polish from the tread

of countless feet.

