#18045
"Clothier's Shoppe"
"You have entered a well-lit elven shop.  Two walls are near-flat trunks, while

the other two are tightly woven branches and living wood and look woven well

enough to keep the warmth in and the cold winds out.  Covering the walls are

articles of clothing, bolts of cloth, spools of thread, and scraps of

leather.  Lovingly crafted dummies of living wood display a variety of

completed projects awaiting their sale.

"
